        "title": "Lstat-first fatal contradicts R6 for a symlinked-but-valid snapshot.",
        "anchor": "",
        "fix": "state the \"regular file\" precondition in R6/R3/step 1 and add a symlink subcase to AC2-4 (no new id), or use Stat and admit symlinked regular targets."
      },
      {
        "id": "CR9-3",
        "class": "statement-contradiction",
        "severity": "LOW",
        "title": "§3 r9 AUTO-DECISION arithmetic is wrong.** \"4096-advance loop (≈41 days of 1ns collisions)\" — 4096 attempts × 1ns ≈ 4.1µs, so \"practically unexhaustable\" is false and 4096 empty pre-created names force the fatal. Fix: correct the estimate; either raise the bound or record reachability as accepted and oracled (Issue 1).",
        "anchor": "",
        "fix": ""
      },
