        "title": "§10 says the r9 delta is \"pending application\", but ticket:91/93/99/103/106/109 already carry r9 text, so its REPLACE sources (e.g. \"mirror of spec r8\") no longer exist; ticket:96 omits the r9 schema-1 declaration though ticket:93 claims r9 amended AC1-2; ticket:103 omits AC1-9(b)(iv).** Fix: record the r9 delta APPLIED with byte-equality verification and complete those two mirror lines.",
        "anchor": "",
        "fix": ""
      },
